# A circuit is a set of connections

A circuit model describes components and the connections between them. Begin by labeling the nodes, then identify which components connect each pair.

## A simple example

Draw one source and one resistor in a closed loop. Label the source voltage and choose a current direction before you calculate.

**Useful relationship:** V = I R

## Pause and try

Draw a simple loop. Label each component and the current direction you choose.

